{%- comment -%}
  NO RATING CLAIM HERE. This card used to show a hardcoded five-star rating
  with "Loved by pet parents / Review-led confidence for daily care
  essentials", on every page the trust bar appears on - blog, collection,
  home, product and search. There were no reviews behind it. Fabricated
  ratings are a named root cause of the Google Merchant Center
  Misrepresentation suspension. Replaced with a delivery fact the store can
  actually stand behind. Do not reintroduce stars without a real review source.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% capture trust_items %}
  <div class="trust-card">
    <span class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
        <path d="M4 7.5h9.5v9H4z"/>
        <path d="M13.5 10h3.2l2.3 2.6v3.9h-5.5z"/>
        <path d="M9 12.5h4"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <strong>Tracked delivery</strong>
    <span>A tracking link is emailed as soon as your order is dispatched</span>
  </div>
  <div class="trust-card">
    <span class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
        <path d="M3 6.5h11v8H3z"/>
        <path d="M14 9h3.8l2.2 2.8v2.7h-6z"/>
        <circle cx="7" cy="17" r="1.8"/>
        <circle cx="17.5" cy="17" r="1.8"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    {%- comment -%} Market-aware, and the same words as the announcement bar: one snippet
        decides both (PRD R8, R11). A visitor outside the UK never sees the UK promise. {%- endcomment -%}
    {% render 'delivery-promise' %}
  </div>
  <div class="trust-card">
    <span class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
        <path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.4-2.9 7.6-7 9-4.1-1.4-7-4.6-7-9V6l7-3z"/>
        <path d="m9 11.5 2.2 2.2L15.5 9.5"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <strong>Care-first support</strong>
    <span>Returns, guides, and FAQs near purchase</span>
  </div>
  <div class="trust-card">
    <span class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
        <rect x="4" y="9" width="16" height="11" rx="1.6"/>
        <path d="M4 12.5h16M12 9v11"/>
        <path d="M12 9c-2.4 0-4.4-1-4.4-2.7C7.6 4.9 8.7 4 10 4c1.7 0 2 2.4 2 5zm0 0c2.4 0 4.4-1 4.4-2.7C16.4 4.9 15.3 4 14 4c-1.7 0-2 2.4-2 5z"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <strong>Bundle-ready picks</strong>
    <span>Pair grooming, toys, walking gear, and paw care</span>
  </div>
  <div class="trust-card">
    <span class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
        <ellipse cx="7" cy="9" rx="1.7" ry="2.3"/>
        <ellipse cx="12" cy="7.4" rx="1.7" ry="2.3"/>
        <ellipse cx="17" cy="9" rx="1.7" ry="2.3"/>
        <path d="M12 12.2c2.6 0 5 2 5 4.3 0 1.4-1.1 2.5-2.5 2.5-1 0-1.8-.5-2.5-.5s-1.5.5-2.5.5C8.1 19 7 17.9 7 16.5c0-2.3 2.4-4.3 5-4.3z"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <strong>Curated pet finds</strong>
    <span>Useful products for dogs, cats, and everyday routines</span>
  </div>
{% endcapture %}

<section class="trust-bar" aria-label="Store benefits">
  <div class="trust-marquee">
    <div class="trust-track">
      {{ trust_items }}
      {{ trust_items }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{ "name": "Trust bar", "settings": [], "presets": [{ "name": "Trust bar" }] }
{% endschema %}
